// IntroString :
"P182002631" "I'm glad you've come. Salamanca seems to be under a deadly curse, and my people are suffering. It all began in October, when those horrible Banished Pantheon creatures started their spells in Paragon City. They released something from the mists around here: something unnatural. Ever since then, we've been fighting to stay alive in the middle of a war zone! As far as I'm concerned, it's my responsibility as mayor to deal with it. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Do you think you can push back those strange Fir Bolg creatures?</A> If you can help me keep my village safe, I'll owe my life to you."
// AcceptString :
"P1796541636" "Push back the Fir Bolg"
// SendOffString :
"P843710174" "All this misery you see around you: it happened overnight! When I became mayor here, I never imagined my peaceful village would turn into a nightmare!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1615430831" "Combat Fir Bolg in Salamanca"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4038840137" "Please, help me rid my village of the Fir Bolg!"

