"P1452451617" "Thank you, my friend. My family's been living in Salamanca for generations. My dad, in particular, did a lot to build it up. I don't intend to see his life's work become a nightmare, {HeroName}. If you can help me save my village, you'll have a friend forever."
// RandomFameString :
"P2115307298" "I hear {HeroName} may help Gordon Bower save Salamanca!"
